OL,3,GNEWSAFastest female comes home to win
OL,4,ASheffield 10k
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people took part in the
OL,7,FSheffield 10K earlier, many of whom
OL,8,Fwere raising money for a variety of
OL,9,Fgood causes.
OL,11,FThe event, organised by Jane
OL,12,FTomlinson's Run For All, started and
OL,13,Fended in Arundel Gate, with
OL,14,Fparticipants passing Endcliffe Park and
OL,15,FBingham Park.
OL,17,FLeo Cossham and Claire Frankland were
OL,18,Fthe fastest male and female runners
OL,19,Fwith a time of 31 minutes 55 seconds
OL,20,Fand 36 minutes one second respectively.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
