OL,3,GNEWSAFastest female comes home to win
OL,4,ASheffield 10k
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrankland said: "I love coming back to
OL,7,FSheffield to race, I grew up here but
OL,8,Fmoved away so to come back and do the
OL,9,F10K and win it, is absolutely
OL,10,Fbrilliant."
